    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "dd58fbf9-8cac-4179-abb4-eb7f7f0758f6",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Chitman Finale: Medical Chit",
        "Location": "LOCATION_HOKKAIDO",
        "PublicId": "110150182925",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository b13314ab-ea25-48b7-9e51-8ebb87788e20).Image",
        "Description": "This is it, 47. Our client has informed us that Chit is disguised as one of 2 patients at the world-class Gamma faciclity in Hokkaido. The first suspect is Amos Dexter. He is a professional cowboy impersonator who has been involved in the Church of Chit for quite some time. The second suspect is Jason Portman. He is gay. If we can eliminate Chit himself, we will certainly curb the efforts of the Church of Chit, leaving them leaderless and without direction.\rGo get it, 47. The Chit awaits",
